---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ProvisioningApp from '../components/ProvisioningApp';
---

<Layout 
  title="Password Protect a File Online - Free File Protection Tool" 
  description="Add password protection to a file directly in your browser. No software required."
>
  <div class="flex-1 bg-bg-light w-full flex items-center justify-center">
    <ProvisioningApp client:load initialMode="file" />
  </div>

  <!-- SEO CONTENT -->
  <section class="w-full bg-white py-16 px-6 border-t border-gray-200">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">How to password protect a file</h2>
      <div class="prose prose-blue text-gray-600">
        <p>FileLocker allows you to secure individual files without uploading them to any server. Our browser-based tool uses advanced cryptography to generate a locked `.vault` file right on your hard drive.</p>
        <ol>
          <li>Select the file you want to protect from your device.</li>
          <li>Enter a secure password that will be used as the encryption key.</li>
          <li>Save the resulting `.vault` file. You can now safely share or store it.</li>
        </ol>
        <p>Because the processing happens locally, there are no limits on file size, and your sensitive data remains entirely private.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
